{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_034_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e940f8ee3eb6003a9b10ba5d65136e253533f2fc49deea9ff09acffcef6a20e6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1c8dac87125bd1fddd42ba6a91f4591f52bb71544d9f0f1f15210b1fd6a4cd9",
      "text": "呐，●●●●プロデューサー。\n和冬马君的练习是什么时候？有几次呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2edd4f3139d2a564b822d14a4935085119cb26a7cb9820156f5ecd35420b587f",
      "text": "关于那件事，因为双方日程安排的关系，\n能够一起练习的机会只有一次。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e032fb829532e8fed0fb1e52ac6a9e2cbf7658372c884163f7125bafcedcc672",
      "text": "哎，这样啊……明明以为能一起做很多次\n练习的说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0eec3abc63050c76eb87c80a043b0de2cfe4eb9a61bd95c96b91b2966910caef",
      "text": "能一起练习绝对是最好的，\n看看能不能想办法调整，我再去确认一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e049bc777a7036ea503caacb234c89e8e77429008d93e7a3a7c22411b74de62b",
      "text": "不用啦，没关系的！就算只有一次能和冬马君\n一起练习！花音就很开心了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:901f15e982375ccdf20e555d364a78c5a94756661144e512a6fe7170cb544500",
      "text": "而且呢，听说冬马君一次都不落下\n一直在坚持自主练习呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a88a9066e2a1cde59e1e5b0d18b2228fc85742ce719fa47f2fd93a890795a0ea",
      "text": "花音也要像冬马君一样\n努力自主练习！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e74eda870e08342ef2bb9a812cab8976d57fe13fc1b87acaa0a21b11096ee99",
      "text": "因为在和冬马君一起练习的时候，\n想要被他觉得好厉害嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0d72a7f369804b4618d2e1de85d2ec5f27299443c0b3e840684503a91106ad9",
      "text": "而且要是那个冬马君觉得花音很厉害的话，\n工作也会大获成功的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd113611a41a3b0a0b3edd2261f88c4dc000efd6d990cbf2b5a82331e1625174",
      "text": "所以，●●●●プロデューサー也\n敬请期待哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
